1
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,120
If we can't get rid of Hathaya,

2
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:12,280
then we'll go after her mother instead.

3
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:14,800
Yai, is something wrong?

4
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,640
He's one of the boss's debt collectors.

5
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:20,600
You said you were close
with those creditors.

6
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:23,320
So why did they beat you like that?

7
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:28,280
Please lend me the five million first.
I know you love me.

8
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:31,160
Are you going to tell me
what happened now?

9
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,800
I'll tell you.

10
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:36,040
Tell me what happened.
And tell me if I can do anything.

11
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:46,000
What are you thinking about?

12
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:50,280
It's Pong.

13
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:54,760
The night it happened, someone called me.

14
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:59,240
But when I went out there,
nothing had happened at all.

15
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:02,440
So I can't stop thinking
that what happened

16
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:06,760
could be connected
to whoever attacked you.

17
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,560
You suspect Pong?

18
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:18,720
If we can find one of Pong's men,
we should be able to get the truth.

19
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,240
I just don't know where they are.

20
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:24,000
I think they probably pick up
jobs around this area.

21
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,120
That day,

22
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:33,040
I secretly took pictures

23
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:36,080
when you told me to keep an eye on them.

24
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,160
Give me a second.

25
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:41,640
I took them in case
they were slacking off.

26
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,560
Good job.

27
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:48,440
Just saying good job is enough.
My face hurts.

28
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:52,280
Then this should be easy. I'll check
the construction sites around here.

29
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,880
I know a lot of foremen.

30
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:06,880
What? You're seeing Yai? And you owe
five million baht in gambling debt?

31
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,760
Didn't you promise Hathaya

32
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:12,120
you'd stay away from gambling?

33
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:16,520
I made a mistake.
What am I supposed to do now, Liu?

34
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:22,920
Five million isn't a big deal.
I could lend it to you.

35
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,640
You'd really lend me the money?

36
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:27,880
The problem is, I just put my money into

37
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:32,120
stocks and funds. They're deep in the red,
so I can't pull anything out yet.

38
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,760
I have to wait another three years.

39
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:39,360
Oh, Liu. What am I supposed to do?

40
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:43,160
Can you help me?

41
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:47,520
Give me some time to think.

42
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,800
I'll find a way to help you.

43
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,920
Thank you so much.

44
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:56,840
I really mean it.

45
00:05:57,520 --> 00:06:00,280
I have no one else to turn to.

46
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:17,200
Aunt Chamoi, have you seen Mom?

47
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:18,760
Whose mom?

48
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:20,560
Mine.

49
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:21,840
Yes.

50
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,760
Where is she?

51
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:28,840
I saw her the other day,
and the day before that,

52
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:31,400
but today, I haven't seen her.

53
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,200
Boo.

54
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,040
Madam.

55
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:44,200
What's going on here?

56
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:48,240
Mom, why are you with Aunt Liu?

57
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:53,360
Haven't you heard
about reducing global warming?

58
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:56,800
If you're going the same way,
you share a ride.

59
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:59,640
I saw your mom walking into the street,

60
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:02,960
so I gave her a ride.
Why? Is that illegal?

61
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,760
It's not illegal.

62
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:09,200
But the sun might rise in the west, madam.

63
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:11,920
Madam,

64
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:15,560
did she splash some kind
of love potion on you?

65
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:19,840
Or did she

66
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,600
put a spell on you

67
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:23,680
until you became her minion?

68
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,040
If you don't stop talking,

69
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:28,360
I'll curse a buffalo hide
into your stomach.

70
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,440
Oh no.

71
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:35,400
Looks like your daughter
isn't very pleased.

72
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:39,320
I swear, kindness is wasted
on some people.

73
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:45,880
Next time you're in trouble,
I won't help you.

74
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,480
I'm sorry for my daughter.

75
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:57,080
Hathaya.

76
00:07:58,080 --> 00:08:00,560
Aunt Liu was kind enough to help me.

77
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:01,720
Apologize to her.

78
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:24,800
Mom, let's go.

79
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:34,280
Madam, what's going on?

80
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:37,600
You two were practically
ready to kill each other,

81
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:40,440
and now you're smiling
and arriving together.

82
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,440
My head hurts.

83
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,320
Take some medicine.

84
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:49,840
Oh my. Madam.

85
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:53,240
I can't keep up. What's happening?

86
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,560
Mom.

87
00:08:57,080 --> 00:09:00,080
I don't understand.
Why are you being nice to Aunt Liu?

88
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:02,400
She helped me.

89
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:06,240
I went out to take care
of something today.

90
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:08,680
A thief tried to snatch my bag.

91
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:12,280
Aunt Liu happened to drive by,
and the thief ran away.

92
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:14,000
If she hadn't helped me,

93
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:16,640
the thief might have killed me.

94
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:19,840
Why didn't you call me?
Did you report it to the police?

95
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:22,480
I got my bag back, so I'm fine.

96
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:25,880
And I didn't call because

97
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:28,000
I was afraid you'd worry about me.

98
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,520
Mom.

99
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,920
If anything happens from now on,
you have to tell me.

100
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,840
Then I can help you deal with it.

101
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:35,880
Okay.

102
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:39,440
But I'm being honest with you.

103
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:41,520
I don't trust Aunt Liu.

104
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:45,000
She's never kind to anyone
without wanting something in return.

105
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:48,160
Maybe that was true before,

106
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:50,520
but she's changed now.

107
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:55,480
Besides, I don't have anything
she could trick me out of anyway.

108
00:09:57,200 --> 00:10:01,200
You trust people too easily.
You need to be careful.

109
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:06,120
I admit I used to trust people too easily,

110
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:09,720
but experience has taught me
to be more careful.

111
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:12,200
I won't cause any more problems.

112
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:16,600
Let's go.

113
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,600
Here you are. Your necklace.

114
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:30,520
You didn't swap it for a fake, did you?

115
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:35,600
Take a good look. I'm over here,

116
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:38,640
and the diamonds are so bright,
they're practically blinding me.

117
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:45,640
But since I carried out
the whole plan successfully,

118
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:49,240
don't I get some kind of reward?

119
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,640
Like that.

120
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:57,240
Wait until Hathai and Hathaya

121
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:59,800
get kicked out of the house,

122
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:04,320
then I'll reward you handsomely.

123
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:07,920
I don't think I can wait that long.

124
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:10,240
How about a deposit first?

125
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:22,320
Do these men work here?

126
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,720
No. I've never seen them.

127
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,800
If you see them, please call me.

128
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,960
-Sure.
-Thank you.

129
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:37,800
Boss, I asked around.

130
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:39,360
Nobody's seen them yet.

131
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:42,160
They work somewhere around here.

132
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,760
Let's go back and try again later.

133
00:11:44,920 --> 00:11:45,880
Okay, boss.

134
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,800
It's hot.

135
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:53,560
I figured out a way

136
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:56,240
to help you get the five million
to pay off your debt.

137
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:58,440
Really? From where?

138
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:03,440
Accounting is withdrawing
a large amount of cash today

139
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:06,840
to pay the workers
and cover other expenses.

140
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:09,120
There should be around
five or six million.

141
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:14,240
But that belongs to the development.
I wouldn't dare borrow it.

142
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:18,120
The workers won't get paid
until this evening.

143
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:20,000
Just use it first.

144
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:23,080
Yai is going to get his money back
and repay you, isn't he?

145
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:25,480
Then you put it back
before anyone notices.

146
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:31,960
Maybe I should talk to Hathaya first.

147
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,440
No.

148
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:34,480
Hey.

149
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:36,640
Your daughter will never
let you borrow it.

150
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:39,400
If Hathaya finds out,

151
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:41,440
she'll forbid you from seeing Yai too.

152
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:44,240
Don't you love him anymore?

153
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:48,000
But I don't want to steal.

154
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:53,160
You're not stealing.
You're borrowing it for a few hours.

155
00:12:54,880 --> 00:12:56,960
I don't dare.

156
00:12:57,040 --> 00:13:00,440
If I get caught, this will
become a huge problem.

157
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:01,880
And if Father finds out,

158
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:04,440
I could end up in prison.

159
00:13:05,160 --> 00:13:06,560
If I don't tell Father,

160
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:08,160
who else is going to know?

161
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:13,360
If you don't want to die,
you have to take the money.

162
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:26,280
You don't have time to think.

163
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,120
Yai.

164
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:44,080
I'm on my way to the DSI right now.

165
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:46,520
I'll get my money back this afternoon.

166
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:48,840
I'll wait for you at the usual place.

167
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,600
What did Yai say?

168
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:04,520
He told me to bring him the money
and said he'd repay it all this afternoon.

169
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:09,000
See? He gave you his word.
He's not going to cheat you.

170
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:10,760
He's a wealthy man, isn't he?

171
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:14,040
He works with ministers
and chiefs. He wouldn't--

172
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:16,480
I'm scared.

173
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:20,000
I'm afraid Father will find out.
And I'm afraid Hathaya will hate me too.

174
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,560
Aren't you afraid of death?

175
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:35,400
How am I supposed to get the money out?

176
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:40,800
That part isn't hard.
I used to handle all the money.

177
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:44,400
Just do exactly what I tell you.

178
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,800
Hathaya.

179
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:14,280
I need to talk to you.

180
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:18,000
Can we talk after work?

181
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,520
I have something I need to finish.

182
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,640
Hey.

183
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:25,600
Which is more important?
Your work or your mom?

184
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,560
What happened?

185
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:36,360
Your mom has a problem. A serious one.

186
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:38,320
Come outside and talk to me.

187
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:43,760
Come on.

188
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:24,320
Boss.

189
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:27,680
Did you find something?

190
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:30,800
A friend at Khlong Si site
said one of the workers

191
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:32,280
from the video is working there.

192
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,240
Let's go.

193
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:42,600
Aunt Liu.

194
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:45,960
This should be private enough.
No one can hear us here.

195
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:48,280
You said this was about Mom.

196
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:50,880
What did she do?

197
00:16:56,800 --> 00:16:58,080
Girls.

198
00:16:58,160 --> 00:16:59,640
Hello, ma'am.

199
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:02,200
I bought som tam for all of you. Go eat.

200
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,440
-Thank you.
-Okay.

201
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:05,359
But it isn't even noon yet.

202
00:17:06,599 --> 00:17:08,480
I already asked Hathaya.

203
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:10,960
Som tam gets soggy
if you leave it too long.

204
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:13,480
But eat it in the garden
in the middle of the development.

205
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:16,560
I ordered the special recipe

206
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:18,280
with fermented fish. It smells strong.

207
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:20,960
-That's my favorite. Thank you.
-Of course.

208
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:22,040
Let's go.

209
00:17:36,760 --> 00:17:39,240
If you don't have anything to say,

210
00:17:39,320 --> 00:17:41,280
I need to get back to work.

211
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:44,760
Wait. Your mom is in gambling debt.

212
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:57,000
How do you know about that?

213
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:01,560
The day I drove your mother home,

214
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:04,960
the debt collectors were chasing her
and trying to kill her.

215
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:07,440
I saved her.

216
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:12,280
Listen.

217
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:16,320
I'm telling you
because I'm worried about you.

218
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:19,560
I don't want your mom
to do something wrong again.

219
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:21,600
And I'm worried that…

220
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:26,520
if she has no job,

221
00:18:26,600 --> 00:18:28,440
where will she get money to pay that debt?

222
00:18:31,560 --> 00:18:34,480
If Grandpa finds out,
you're going to be in trouble too.

223
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:41,960
I'm warning you because I mean well.

224
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:10,280
Miss Hathaya, thank you so much.

225
00:19:11,040 --> 00:19:12,520
For what?

226
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:15,680
Your mom bought us food.

227
00:19:15,760 --> 00:19:18,040
She said you gave us permission to go eat.

228
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:20,000
Where is my mom?

229
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,840
We're going to eat the som tam now.

230
00:19:31,760 --> 00:19:33,080
Enjoy.

231
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:35,240
Thank you.

232
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:52,120
Hathaya.

233
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:55,080
What are you in such a hurry to find?

234
00:19:57,160 --> 00:20:00,400
The bag of cash is gone. The whole bag.

235
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:02,560
Oh my God.

236
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:06,760
Your mom must have stolen the money.

237
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:11,400
Mom doesn't have the key
to the safe. She didn't do it.

238
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:18,080
I had a spare key made for you. Take it.

239
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:20,840
Then you can use
the money to pay your debt.

240
00:20:28,280 --> 00:20:29,680
Your mom stole the money.

241
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:33,120
She wouldn't do that.

242
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:36,520
If it wasn't her, then who was it?

243
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:38,040
She deliberately got all the staff

244
00:20:38,120 --> 00:20:39,880
out of the office.

245
00:20:41,360 --> 00:20:42,880
What happened?

246
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:45,640
Hathaya's mom stole the money.

247
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:50,880
Aunt Liu, don't say that.

248
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:53,520
You don't have any evidence
that Mom stole it.

249
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:55,680
Fine.

250
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:59,280
Then check the security cameras.

251
00:20:59,360 --> 00:21:02,080
We'll see who came into this room.

252
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:19,560
One of Pong's men
is working upstairs, boss.

253
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:36,240
You used to work for Pong, didn't you?

254
00:22:00,800 --> 00:22:01,920
Come back here.

255
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:11,720
Take this.

256
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:18,800
Run again.

257
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:21,600
If you try running,
I'll kick your guts out.

258
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:22,480
Uh…

259
00:22:23,360 --> 00:22:26,640
Why are you attacking me? What did I do?

260
00:22:27,440 --> 00:22:29,160
If you didn't do anything,
why did you run?

261
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:32,560
I was scared.
You suddenly came charging at me.

262
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:34,320
Don't hurt me,

263
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:37,880
or I'll report you
to the police for assault,

264
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:40,960
and I'll hire a lawyer too.

265
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:42,680
I'll take this all the way.

266
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:45,160
Smart one, aren't you?

267
00:22:46,760 --> 00:22:48,240
You want the police involved?

268
00:22:48,320 --> 00:22:50,280
Fine. I'll call them myself.

269
00:22:51,280 --> 00:22:53,040
Then they can question you

270
00:22:53,120 --> 00:22:54,840
about where you went that night

271
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:58,240
after leaving my site

272
00:22:58,320 --> 00:23:01,520
and whose number was used to call me

273
00:23:01,600 --> 00:23:03,040
and lure me away.

274
00:23:03,800 --> 00:23:05,880
Funny coincidence too. That same night,

275
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:09,040
Hathaya was nearly raped.
What a coincidence.

276
00:23:10,520 --> 00:23:12,800
I… I don't know.

277
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:14,840
Max.

278
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:16,520
Call the police.

279
00:23:17,600 --> 00:23:19,840
I'll report you for attempted murder.

280
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:24,760
Attempted murder can get you

281
00:23:24,840 --> 00:23:26,320
a death sentence.

282
00:23:29,320 --> 00:23:30,280
I'm calling.

283
00:23:30,360 --> 00:23:32,600
Don't call.

284
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:35,000
I'll tell you. I'll tell you everything.

285
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:39,080
If I tell you, let me go. Don't hurt me.

286
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:41,080
Then talk.

287
00:23:42,280 --> 00:23:45,000
Pong. Pong ordered it.

288
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:57,080
I'm waiting for you
at the usual place, Hathai.

289
00:23:57,160 --> 00:23:59,400
See you soon, my love.

290
00:24:03,760 --> 00:24:06,440
Pong ordered me and the others

291
00:24:06,520 --> 00:24:08,240
to gang-rape Hathaya.

292
00:24:08,800 --> 00:24:10,680
Pong was behind the whole thing.

293
00:24:10,760 --> 00:24:13,400
I told you everything. Please let me go.

294
00:24:15,800 --> 00:24:18,320
I never said I'd let you go.

295
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:20,280
You decided that all by yourself.

296
00:24:20,360 --> 00:24:22,480
Max, hold him.

297
00:24:22,560 --> 00:24:23,440
Got it.

298
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:26,360
I'm calling the police
to come pick him up.

299
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:28,080
I'm going after Pong.

300
00:24:30,120 --> 00:24:31,320
Run if you dare.

301
00:24:32,840 --> 00:24:35,080
HATHAYA

302
00:24:37,080 --> 00:24:38,400
What is it, Hathaya?

303
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:42,320
Okay. I'm coming.

304
00:24:43,760 --> 00:24:44,920
Max, watch him.

305
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:48,480
Yai.

306
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:50,920
Where are you?

307
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:53,680
I brought you the money.

308
00:24:53,760 --> 00:24:57,800
Have you gotten back the money
that was frozen yet?

309
00:24:58,440 --> 00:25:00,200
I'll definitely get it back
this afternoon.

310
00:25:00,280 --> 00:25:02,640
I feel terrible.

311
00:25:03,240 --> 00:25:05,200
I stole the office's money.

312
00:25:05,920 --> 00:25:08,240
My daughter is definitely
going to be in trouble

313
00:25:08,320 --> 00:25:10,560
if my father-in-law finds out,

314
00:25:10,640 --> 00:25:13,320
and I could end up in prison.

315
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:17,000
I understand how you feel.

316
00:25:17,760 --> 00:25:20,120
But don't worry. I promise

317
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:22,600
we'll have the money back this afternoon.

318
00:25:26,560 --> 00:25:27,800
Hathai.

319
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:30,440
You don't have to worry about anything.

320
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:32,320
I have the official paperwork

321
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:35,760
releasing my frozen assets right here

322
00:25:35,840 --> 00:25:38,200
in my hands.

323
00:25:39,760 --> 00:25:41,080
Don't go quiet on me.

324
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:42,520
How about this?

325
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:44,680
I'll write you a check for 50 million

326
00:25:44,760 --> 00:25:47,280
and bring it to you. Okay?

327
00:25:48,040 --> 00:25:51,320
I understand how you feel.

328
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:54,320
Your daughter doesn't trust you.
She doesn't believe in you.

329
00:25:55,040 --> 00:25:56,720
But what you're doing…

330
00:25:56,800 --> 00:25:59,200
I believe your daughter
will be proud of you.

331
00:25:59,280 --> 00:26:02,520
Just like I'm proud of you and admire you.

332
00:26:04,920 --> 00:26:07,400
I already had Max coordinate
with the police about Pong.

333
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:09,720
They'll also charge his men
for the assault.

334
00:26:09,800 --> 00:26:12,600
I never imagined it would be
someone so close to us, like Pong.

335
00:26:13,120 --> 00:26:16,400
How do you know your mom is here?

336
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:19,960
I put a mini GPS tracker inside
the cash bag as an anti-theft measure.

337
00:26:20,760 --> 00:26:22,080
Mom should be somewhere here.

338
00:26:31,880 --> 00:26:33,200
Have you been waiting long?

339
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:35,480
Not long.

340
00:26:36,080 --> 00:26:37,040
Alright.

341
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:40,000
I can carry it.

342
00:26:40,080 --> 00:26:44,080
And we should go together. That way, I can
sign the document to settle the loan.

343
00:26:45,280 --> 00:26:46,840
No need for you to sign anything.

344
00:26:46,920 --> 00:26:51,080
Wait here. I'll take the money over,
repay them, and come right back.

345
00:26:52,120 --> 00:26:53,720
Then let's go together.

346
00:26:57,440 --> 00:27:01,000
It hurts me that you don't trust me.

347
00:27:02,320 --> 00:27:05,800
That's not it. I just want to go with you.

348
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:09,520
All right. How about this?

349
00:27:09,600 --> 00:27:12,280
There's a check for 50 million
in this envelope.

350
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:15,440
Keep it with you. Okay?

351
00:27:15,520 --> 00:27:17,760
When I come back,
I'll take you to open an account.

352
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:19,880
Okay, my darling?

353
00:27:23,400 --> 00:27:24,680
Come on.

354
00:27:25,520 --> 00:27:27,120
I told you before.

355
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:30,200
I've never felt this way
about any other woman.

356
00:27:30,840 --> 00:27:32,480
Only you.

357
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:39,080
Go find a nice restaurant.

358
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:41,480
Sit down, have some good food, relax.

359
00:27:41,560 --> 00:27:43,640
You look really stressed right now.

360
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:46,880
There's nothing to worry about.
I'll be back.

361
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:48,000
Okay?

362
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:51,920
Come back quickly.

363
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:54,480
Of course. I'll hurry back to you.

364
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:56,960
Then we'll go see your daughter together.

365
00:27:57,480 --> 00:28:00,160
We'll tell her the whole truth.

366
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:01,840
And most importantly,

367
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:06,720
I'll formally ask your daughter
for permission to marry you.

368
00:28:08,200 --> 00:28:09,040
Okay?

369
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:15,000
See you soon. Keep this.

370
00:28:15,080 --> 00:28:17,200
Give me the bag.

371
00:28:18,320 --> 00:28:19,400
Keep it.

372
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:21,280
I'll be right back.

373
00:28:21,880 --> 00:28:22,840
Okay.

374
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,600
Come back soon.

375
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:26,880
Of course.

376
00:28:36,680 --> 00:28:37,800
Mom.

377
00:28:38,400 --> 00:28:39,960
Did you steal the money from the office?

378
00:28:44,920 --> 00:28:45,760
Um…

379
00:28:47,240 --> 00:28:49,600
No, I didn't steal it.

380
00:28:49,680 --> 00:28:52,160
Yai borrowed it from me.

381
00:28:52,240 --> 00:28:54,200
He's going to repay it this afternoon.

382
00:28:54,280 --> 00:28:57,480
And he told me he's going
to give me 50 million.

383
00:28:58,080 --> 00:29:00,400
Mom, who is this man?

384
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:02,840
And why would he give you 50 million?

385
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:04,960
Because he's a billionaire.

386
00:29:05,040 --> 00:29:07,240
And he knows all kinds of powerful people.

387
00:29:07,320 --> 00:29:08,960
If he's that rich,

388
00:29:09,040 --> 00:29:11,040
why can't he pay back
five million himself?

389
00:29:12,440 --> 00:29:14,760
He was linked to an online gambling case

390
00:29:14,840 --> 00:29:17,200
and his assets were frozen.

391
00:29:17,280 --> 00:29:19,160
But he's going to get the money back now.

392
00:29:19,240 --> 00:29:22,400
And look. Here are the documents
releasing the money.

393
00:29:23,760 --> 00:29:24,960
May I?

394
00:29:38,160 --> 00:29:41,120
There isn't even an official stamp.

395
00:29:41,200 --> 00:29:42,080
These look fake.

396
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:44,920
They're not fake. Just the other day,

397
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:47,560
he was talking
to the Director-General of the DSI.

398
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:48,760
And look.

399
00:29:48,840 --> 00:29:51,040
He even wrote me a check for 50 million.

400
00:29:52,080 --> 00:29:53,280
Mom.

401
00:29:53,360 --> 00:29:57,160
He can write any number he wants on this.
A billion. A hundred million.

402
00:29:57,240 --> 00:30:00,040
But if there's no money in his account,
you can't cash it.

403
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:06,880
Where is this Yai now?

404
00:30:12,520 --> 00:30:14,240
YOU - TARGET

405
00:30:15,040 --> 00:30:16,400
He went that way.

406
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:19,680
Come on.

407
00:30:31,680 --> 00:30:34,520
-Here's your money, madam.
-You did very well.

408
00:30:36,720 --> 00:30:38,520
This wasn't exactly an easy job.

409
00:30:38,600 --> 00:30:42,000
Don't you think I deserve a tip?
Or maybe a cut?

410
00:30:43,560 --> 00:30:46,440
Stop playing games.
Give me the bag. Hand it over.

411
00:30:46,520 --> 00:30:47,640
And what if I don't?

412
00:30:48,280 --> 00:30:49,440
What are you going to do?

413
00:30:52,080 --> 00:30:53,280
Are you trying to cheat me?

414
00:30:54,880 --> 00:30:55,720
Madam.

415
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:58,720
I would never cheat you.

416
00:30:58,800 --> 00:31:00,680
I'd never betray you either.

417
00:31:00,760 --> 00:31:04,080
Whenever you tell me
to do something, I do it.

418
00:31:07,440 --> 00:31:10,160
Fine. I'll transfer enough money

419
00:31:10,240 --> 00:31:12,320
to make all your hard work worthwhile.

420
00:31:18,120 --> 00:31:21,160
What? Why the hell are you calling me now?

421
00:31:23,880 --> 00:31:25,000
What?

422
00:31:28,560 --> 00:31:29,560
What happened?

423
00:31:30,960 --> 00:31:32,480
One of the guys

424
00:31:32,560 --> 00:31:35,720
I sent to rape Hathaya
got caught by Ramil.

425
00:31:35,800 --> 00:31:37,880
He confessed that I was the one behind it.

426
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:40,400
Damn it.

427
00:31:41,040 --> 00:31:41,880
Then…

428
00:31:42,720 --> 00:31:44,640
Then you need to run.

429
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:46,680
And don't let them
trace any of this back to me.

430
00:31:47,840 --> 00:31:48,840
Go.

431
00:32:01,360 --> 00:32:02,720
Yai.

432
00:32:03,320 --> 00:32:04,640
Hathaya.

433
00:32:05,680 --> 00:32:08,080
Here he is. This is Yai.

434
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:09,720
Yai.

435
00:32:09,800 --> 00:32:11,440
This is Hathaya, my daughter.

436
00:32:11,520 --> 00:32:13,800
The one I told you about. Do you remember?

437
00:32:15,320 --> 00:32:20,600
-Of course.
-My daughter doesn't believe

438
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:23,960
you're going to repay me.
She says the check

439
00:32:24,040 --> 00:32:26,320
and all the documents are fake.

440
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:29,760
Could you please tell her that isn't true?

441
00:32:29,840 --> 00:32:30,720
Of course.

442
00:32:30,800 --> 00:32:32,040
Auntie.

443
00:32:33,080 --> 00:32:35,360
He isn't some tycoon,
and his name isn't Yai either.

444
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,200
His name is Pong.

445
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:41,520
He's a foreman at the development.

446
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:45,960
No. Yai owns a travel agency.

447
00:32:46,040 --> 00:32:48,680
He arranges trips
for ministers and chiefs.

448
00:32:48,760 --> 00:32:50,960
Mom, you're the one who's mistaken.

449
00:32:51,040 --> 00:32:53,840
His name is Pong.
Aunt Liu brought him here to work.

450
00:32:53,920 --> 00:32:56,080
He even lives in the workers' housing.

451
00:32:59,680 --> 00:33:04,000
Yai, please tell me that isn't true.

452
00:33:06,240 --> 00:33:08,920
Tell my mom the truth.
Tell her your name is Pong.

453
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:10,880
Tell her you tricked her
to a gambling den.

454
00:33:10,960 --> 00:33:12,520
Where is my mom's money?

455
00:33:12,600 --> 00:33:14,960
What money? What are you talking about?

456
00:33:16,240 --> 00:33:17,120
The…

457
00:33:17,200 --> 00:33:19,120
The bag of cash I gave you.

458
00:33:19,720 --> 00:33:23,200
What money? I don't know
what you're talking about.

459
00:33:23,280 --> 00:33:24,920
And that's not all.

460
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:29,480
He also sent his workers
to try to rape Hathaya.

461
00:33:34,360 --> 00:33:36,760
-Mom, go ahead.
-Then I'll go.

462
00:33:37,520 --> 00:33:38,800
He made plans with me and didn't show up.

463
00:33:39,960 --> 00:33:41,120
He won't answer my calls either.

464
00:33:42,320 --> 00:33:43,320
Hey.

465
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:46,600
That night, you tricked me
into waiting at the restaurant

466
00:33:47,480 --> 00:33:49,880
while you went after my daughter
and tried to rape her?

467
00:33:52,360 --> 00:33:54,840
-How could you do that, you bastard?
-What the hell?

468
00:33:54,920 --> 00:33:57,120
-I've never met anyone like you.
-Stop.

469
00:33:57,720 --> 00:33:59,640
-You're evil.
-Mom.

470
00:33:59,720 --> 00:34:01,840
You bastard.

471
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:03,680
You piece of filth.

472
00:34:03,760 --> 00:34:05,280
-Let go of me.
-Let her go.

473
00:34:05,360 --> 00:34:06,520
Back off.

474
00:34:08,199 --> 00:34:09,480
Pong, calm down.

475
00:34:09,560 --> 00:34:11,320
Come any closer and I'll stab her.

476
00:34:12,679 --> 00:34:13,600
Back off.

477
00:34:15,080 --> 00:34:16,400
Hathaya.

478
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:18,280
Calm down, Pong.

479
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:19,520
I'm done being calm.

480
00:34:21,080 --> 00:34:23,320
Back off. Anyone follows me,
and I'll stab her.

481
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:25,679
-Mom.
-Hurry up!

482
00:34:25,760 --> 00:34:26,760
Mom.

483
00:34:29,679 --> 00:34:32,480
Let go. Let me go right now.

484
00:34:32,560 --> 00:34:33,600
-Let go.
-No.

485
00:34:33,679 --> 00:34:35,520
I said

486
00:34:35,600 --> 00:34:37,280
let go.

487
00:34:40,760 --> 00:34:41,760
Damn you.

488
00:34:41,840 --> 00:34:43,639
How could you do this to me?

489
00:34:46,880 --> 00:34:47,840
Hey.

490
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:50,880
Listen to me. You were stupid.

491
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:53,080
As soon as you saw a rich man,
you jumped on him.

492
00:34:53,159 --> 00:34:55,199
You're obsessed with money.

493
00:34:58,160 --> 00:34:59,160
Go.

494
00:34:59,800 --> 00:35:01,320
-You bastard.
-Stop.

495
00:35:01,400 --> 00:35:04,080
I curse you.
I hope you come to a horrible end.

496
00:35:05,360 --> 00:35:06,440
Look out.

497
00:35:09,680 --> 00:35:11,160
Go. The police are coming.

498
00:35:36,200 --> 00:35:38,120
Someone else has the bag now.

499
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:40,040
Send the police the location.

500
00:35:40,120 --> 00:35:40,960
We need the money back.

501
00:36:12,520 --> 00:36:13,960
You think I'm stupid?

502
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:31,880
Ramil. What happened?

503
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:36,920
The GPS has been destroyed.

504
00:36:38,440 --> 00:36:40,040
Whoever took the bag got away.

505
00:36:41,320 --> 00:36:44,760
If the police catch Pong,
we'll find out who was behind everything.

506
00:36:54,640 --> 00:36:55,560
Go.

507
00:36:56,680 --> 00:36:57,920
Take care of your mom.

508
00:37:05,480 --> 00:37:09,000
Father, I don't want to say too much.

509
00:37:09,080 --> 00:37:11,920
You'll think I'm making things up
and trying to frame her.

510
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:15,360
So just look at the security footage
and see for yourself

511
00:37:15,440 --> 00:37:17,680
what your eldest daughter-in-law

512
00:37:17,760 --> 00:37:19,760
has done this time.

513
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:41,520
Hathai stole money from the office.

514
00:37:41,600 --> 00:37:44,040
This is very serious.

515
00:37:44,120 --> 00:37:47,200
You have to report her
and have her sent to prison.

516
00:37:47,280 --> 00:37:49,920
If you let this go,
it sets a terrible example

517
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:51,640
for the employees.

518
00:37:51,720 --> 00:37:53,680
All right. That's enough.

519
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:56,560
Where's Hathaya? Go get her.

520
00:37:58,720 --> 00:37:59,600
Yes.

521
00:38:25,040 --> 00:38:26,200
Hathaya.

522
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:32,160
If you're angry

523
00:38:32,680 --> 00:38:34,200
or upset with me,

524
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:36,200
say something.

525
00:38:36,720 --> 00:38:38,680
Don't just stay silent like this.

526
00:38:47,760 --> 00:38:49,440
What else do you want me to do?

527
00:38:51,680 --> 00:38:53,960
You can yell at me.
You can say anything you want.

528
00:38:54,680 --> 00:38:57,440
Just don't act like I don't exist.

529
00:39:00,960 --> 00:39:02,760
I don't know what to say.

530
00:39:04,040 --> 00:39:05,600
I really don't.

531
00:39:08,200 --> 00:39:11,040
I can't think
of anything else to say to you.

532
00:39:16,520 --> 00:39:17,880
Hathaya.

533
00:39:18,880 --> 00:39:19,760
I'm sorry.

534
00:39:25,280 --> 00:39:27,000
Can you forgive me?

535
00:39:33,560 --> 00:39:35,040
How much longer will you talk?

536
00:39:36,120 --> 00:39:38,320
Father has been waiting for you.

537
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:40,960
-Chamoi.
-Yes, madam?

538
00:39:41,040 --> 00:39:42,880
Go tell Ann and the others

539
00:39:42,960 --> 00:39:45,600
to pack up their things.

540
00:39:46,120 --> 00:39:50,040
Father is definitely going to throw
both of them out of the house.

541
00:39:51,080 --> 00:39:52,560
Yes, madam.

542
00:40:00,320 --> 00:40:01,440
Come on.

543
00:40:29,160 --> 00:40:32,280
Grandpa, I'm sorry.

544
00:40:36,200 --> 00:40:39,320
Isn't an apology a little too easy?

545
00:40:39,400 --> 00:40:42,320
Your mom stole money.
She acted like a thief.

546
00:40:45,800 --> 00:40:49,040
You can't just let something like this go.
She has to be punished.

547
00:40:51,040 --> 00:40:53,040
Do you have anything to explain?

548
00:40:54,920 --> 00:40:56,240
No, Grandpa.

549
00:40:56,760 --> 00:40:58,760
Mom really did take the money.

550
00:41:04,000 --> 00:41:06,120
Hathaya admits it.

551
00:41:06,200 --> 00:41:09,280
Then you have to punish Hathaya too.

552
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:12,240
She was responsible for that money,

553
00:41:12,320 --> 00:41:15,080
yet she allowed
her own mother to steal it.

554
00:41:16,280 --> 00:41:18,040
And Hathaya was the one who said

555
00:41:18,120 --> 00:41:20,240
she would take care of her mother

556
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:21,960
and stop her from causing trouble.

557
00:41:22,040 --> 00:41:23,880
Today proves that

558
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:26,360
Hathaya couldn't do what she said.

559
00:41:28,680 --> 00:41:31,040
And how do you think Hathaya
should take responsibility?

560
00:41:32,960 --> 00:41:34,720
She has to repay the money.

561
00:41:35,240 --> 00:41:37,600
And if she can't repay it,

562
00:41:37,680 --> 00:41:40,640
then she should be treated
as an accomplice.

563
00:41:46,960 --> 00:41:47,960
I'll take responsibility.

564
00:41:51,240 --> 00:41:53,240
This has nothing to do with you.

565
00:41:54,520 --> 00:41:56,240
I'm Hathaya's husband.

566
00:41:57,120 --> 00:41:58,080
I'll take the blame.

567
00:42:00,800 --> 00:42:03,800
And where are you going to get the money?

568
00:42:03,880 --> 00:42:05,800
You can barely take care of yourself.

569
00:42:07,160 --> 00:42:10,080
I'll keep following the case
until the police catch Pong

570
00:42:10,160 --> 00:42:11,680
and recover the money.

571
00:42:15,360 --> 00:42:18,520
You think catching a thief is that easy?

572
00:42:18,600 --> 00:42:21,960
By now, the one behind this has probably
taken the money and gone far away.

573
00:42:22,040 --> 00:42:25,040
No matter what happens,
I'll find a way to repay it.

574
00:42:25,120 --> 00:42:27,200
I'm only asking for some time, sir.

575
00:42:27,280 --> 00:42:29,320
But I want the money today.

576
00:42:29,920 --> 00:42:31,000
Enough.

577
00:42:31,640 --> 00:42:33,680
I'll give you one month.

578
00:42:34,720 --> 00:42:38,360
Return the five million to me.
Otherwise, I'll have to take legal action.

579
00:42:39,080 --> 00:42:40,160
Thank you, sir.

580
00:42:56,880 --> 00:42:58,040
Finally.

581
00:42:58,840 --> 00:42:59,720
Alright.

582
00:42:59,800 --> 00:43:01,800
Go.

583
00:43:01,880 --> 00:43:03,600
Finally.

584
00:43:07,000 --> 00:43:08,440
Just go away.

585
00:43:10,240 --> 00:43:13,880
Now that the money issue is settled,
let's deal with the thief.

586
00:43:13,960 --> 00:43:16,400
Father, you can't let a thief stay here.

587
00:43:16,480 --> 00:43:19,120
It sets a terrible example
for the employees.

588
00:43:20,440 --> 00:43:23,240
You have to send Hathai to prison.

589
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:27,400
Then arrest me, Father.

590
00:43:27,480 --> 00:43:29,560
And also arrest the person
who manipulated me.

591
00:43:32,160 --> 00:43:33,480
Who do you mean?

592
00:43:34,480 --> 00:43:37,160
Liu. She's the one
who pushed me into doing this.

593
00:43:40,000 --> 00:43:43,520
You really are something. You're about
to be thrown out of the house,

594
00:43:43,600 --> 00:43:45,600
and you're trying to frame me.

595
00:43:46,120 --> 00:43:48,640
You want to drag me down to hell with you?

596
00:43:48,720 --> 00:43:51,240
You were the one who pressured me.

597
00:43:52,240 --> 00:43:56,120
Then list everything I supposedly did.

598
00:43:56,200 --> 00:43:59,240
I'd love to hear what kind of story

599
00:43:59,320 --> 00:44:01,960
you're going to invent. Go on.

600
00:44:03,440 --> 00:44:04,760
Father.

601
00:44:04,840 --> 00:44:06,640
Liu was the one who told me

602
00:44:06,720 --> 00:44:09,240
to steal the money
from the safe to pay off the debt.

603
00:44:09,320 --> 00:44:12,520
And Liu was the one
who gave me the key to the safe.

604
00:44:13,200 --> 00:44:15,480
She planned everything.

605
00:44:16,080 --> 00:44:19,120
If you're going to have me arrested,
then you have to arrest Liu too.

606
00:44:23,560 --> 00:44:27,400
Very dramatic. Listening to that story

607
00:44:27,480 --> 00:44:30,440
makes every TV drama I've ever watched

608
00:44:30,960 --> 00:44:32,480
seem boring.

609
00:44:32,560 --> 00:44:34,280
Stop lying

610
00:44:34,360 --> 00:44:36,520
and admit the truth.

611
00:44:36,600 --> 00:44:38,320
And what exactly am I supposed to admit?

612
00:44:38,400 --> 00:44:41,760
Where's your evidence? When I supposedly
told you to steal the money,

613
00:44:41,840 --> 00:44:43,640
or when I supposedly gave you the key,

614
00:44:43,720 --> 00:44:45,560
is there a video?

615
00:44:45,640 --> 00:44:47,240
If you didn't give me the key,

616
00:44:47,320 --> 00:44:49,160
where would I have gotten it?

617
00:44:49,960 --> 00:44:51,160
Everyone saw you

618
00:44:51,240 --> 00:44:53,800
helping your daughter
in the accounting office.

619
00:44:53,880 --> 00:44:56,080
You planned everything.

620
00:44:56,160 --> 00:44:59,120
You searched around for the key,
made yourself a copy,

621
00:44:59,200 --> 00:45:02,120
then waited for the right opportunity
to steal the money.

622
00:45:03,160 --> 00:45:06,560
You really are an expert liar and actress.

623
00:45:06,640 --> 00:45:09,280
You're the one who deserves
an award for acting.

624
00:45:09,800 --> 00:45:12,080
Pong works for you.

625
00:45:12,160 --> 00:45:15,080
But whenever you saw him,
you pretended you didn't even know him.

626
00:45:18,400 --> 00:45:21,080
Wait. Were you

627
00:45:21,160 --> 00:45:23,480
the one behind all of this
from the beginning?

628
00:45:27,840 --> 00:45:28,840
Right.

629
00:45:29,360 --> 00:45:32,480
You wanted to get rid of me

630
00:45:32,560 --> 00:45:34,400
and my daughter.

631
00:45:35,000 --> 00:45:37,320
You planned the whole thing, didn't you?

632
00:45:38,480 --> 00:45:40,280
Don't accuse me without proof.

633
00:45:41,760 --> 00:45:44,520
Where's your evidence? You have nothing.

634
00:45:45,520 --> 00:45:49,160
Father, you can't listen
to a thief making excuses.

635
00:45:50,080 --> 00:45:51,120
Enough.

636
00:45:55,160 --> 00:45:56,080
Father.

637
00:45:56,160 --> 00:45:58,960
You have to be fair to me too.

638
00:45:59,040 --> 00:46:02,120
And you, Hathaya. You need
to take responsibility as well.

639
00:46:02,200 --> 00:46:04,880
You were the one
who brought a thief into this house.

640
00:46:12,920 --> 00:46:14,200
Grandpa.

641
00:46:16,000 --> 00:46:17,120
I'm sorry.

642
00:46:21,720 --> 00:46:23,120
I'm so sorry.

643
00:46:33,120 --> 00:46:34,800
I was the one

644
00:46:35,880 --> 00:46:39,600
who asked you to let Mom
stay in this house.

645
00:46:40,800 --> 00:46:44,680
I promised you that
I would take good care of her.

646
00:46:45,880 --> 00:46:47,160
And I promised that

647
00:46:47,680 --> 00:46:50,000
if anything bad happened,

648
00:46:51,240 --> 00:46:52,760
I would take responsibility.

649
00:46:59,800 --> 00:47:01,480
Mom did something wrong.

650
00:47:02,800 --> 00:47:04,960
So I'll leave this house with her.

651
00:47:06,200 --> 00:47:09,240
No, sweetheart. Hathaya.

652
00:47:09,840 --> 00:47:11,560
Thank you.

653
00:47:11,640 --> 00:47:13,640
At least you're keeping your word.

654
00:47:14,480 --> 00:47:15,560
Chamoi.

655
00:47:17,040 --> 00:47:19,200
Go pack their things.

656
00:47:19,720 --> 00:47:21,840
And take your mom and get out of here.

657
00:47:22,640 --> 00:47:23,760
Yes.

658
00:47:23,840 --> 00:47:24,720
Wait.

659
00:47:26,640 --> 00:47:28,840
If you expect Hathaya
to take responsibility

660
00:47:28,920 --> 00:47:31,200
for her mother's wrongdoing,

661
00:47:32,320 --> 00:47:35,280
then take responsibility
for your subordinate's wrongdoing too.

662
00:47:37,800 --> 00:47:39,360
What do you mean, Father?

663
00:47:39,920 --> 00:47:42,640
You were the one
who brought Pong here to work.

664
00:47:43,360 --> 00:47:45,760
You vouched for him
and told me he was a good man.

665
00:47:47,360 --> 00:47:49,880
You even suggested letting him stay
in the workers' housing.

666
00:47:52,000 --> 00:47:54,120
Pong repeatedly caused problems at work.

667
00:47:54,640 --> 00:47:56,920
Then he was vile enough
to try to rape Hathaya.

668
00:47:57,640 --> 00:47:59,600
And he manipulated Hathai
out of the money.

669
00:48:03,160 --> 00:48:05,040
You should take responsibility
for Pong too.

670
00:48:05,640 --> 00:48:08,360
Father, I truly had no idea

671
00:48:08,440 --> 00:48:10,720
Pong would do such terrible things.

672
00:48:10,800 --> 00:48:12,680
This has nothing to do with me.

673
00:48:12,760 --> 00:48:14,480
You need to separate the issues.

674
00:48:14,560 --> 00:48:18,320
The person who commits
the crime should be punished.

675
00:48:19,000 --> 00:48:20,360
If that's your argument,

676
00:48:20,960 --> 00:48:22,160
Hathaya isn't guilty either.

677
00:48:27,160 --> 00:48:28,200
Hathaya.

678
00:48:28,920 --> 00:48:31,000
You were the one
who brought your mom here.

679
00:48:31,520 --> 00:48:33,920
I already told you I wanted
nothing to do with her.

680
00:48:36,800 --> 00:48:38,320
Since your mom did something wrong,

681
00:48:39,480 --> 00:48:42,360
the person who has to deal with it is you.

682
00:48:52,680 --> 00:48:56,160
Father is unbelievable.
That wasn't fair at all.

683
00:48:56,240 --> 00:48:59,160
He should've thrown
both mother and daughter out.

684
00:48:59,240 --> 00:49:01,320
Master made the right decision.

685
00:49:01,400 --> 00:49:03,200
You did something wrong too, madam.

686
00:49:03,280 --> 00:49:05,000
You brought a criminal into the house.

687
00:49:05,080 --> 00:49:07,240
If you want Hathaya thrown out,

688
00:49:07,320 --> 00:49:09,160
then you'd have to throw yourself out too.

689
00:49:09,240 --> 00:49:11,320
Chamoi, you really have a foul mouth.

690
00:49:12,240 --> 00:49:13,240
I'll slap your teeth out.

691
00:49:13,320 --> 00:49:16,520
Madam, what are you going to do now?

692
00:49:17,320 --> 00:49:19,680
What can I do? I'm furious.

693
00:49:19,760 --> 00:49:22,640
Hathaya is obviously going
to let her mom stay.

694
00:49:24,200 --> 00:49:25,960
I'm not so sure.

695
00:49:26,040 --> 00:49:30,800
I noticed Hathaya was pretty cold
toward her mom today.

696
00:49:31,640 --> 00:49:35,160
That's true. She didn't defend her at all.

697
00:49:35,240 --> 00:49:37,680
And she loves her mom so much.

698
00:49:37,760 --> 00:49:39,320
But Hathai

699
00:49:39,400 --> 00:49:41,800
keeps making the same mistakes
over and over.

700
00:49:42,640 --> 00:49:45,920
-Where are you going, madam?
-To watch the drama.

701
00:49:46,680 --> 00:49:48,400
They tricked me.

702
00:49:48,480 --> 00:49:50,520
I don't care who was behind it.

703
00:49:50,600 --> 00:49:52,720
What hurts me

704
00:49:52,800 --> 00:49:54,760
is that you broke your promise.

705
00:49:54,840 --> 00:49:56,600
That's why I hired those men to rape her.

706
00:49:56,680 --> 00:49:58,320
It's just a shame they failed.

707
00:49:58,400 --> 00:49:59,760
She's your relative.

708
00:49:59,840 --> 00:50:01,600
I've never considered her family.

709
00:50:01,680 --> 00:50:03,480
Break up with Chayanee.

710
00:50:03,560 --> 00:50:04,680
Chayanee won't accept that.

711
00:50:05,840 --> 00:50:08,680
I'll find you a woman who's better
and more capable myself.

712
00:50:08,760 --> 00:50:09,680
Stop acting crazy.

713
00:50:09,760 --> 00:50:11,840
If you break up with me,
you will regret it.

714
00:50:11,920 --> 00:50:12,840
Get up.

715
00:50:12,920 --> 00:50:14,520
I don't mind.

716
00:52:10,960 --> 00:52:12,960
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
